  "description": "Bring your fashion illustrations and digital artwork to life with this premium set of 13 Procreate fabric texture brushes! Designed to mimic the look and feel of real textiles, these brushes are perfect for fashion sketches, textile illustrations, digital collages, and surface pattern designs. They add realistic fabric effects with ease, including; Corduroy, Quilt, Lace, Twill/Denim, Heather, Leather, Felt….and more. \nFeatures:\n– 13 High-quality Procreate brushes of seamless fabric textures.\n– Easy to install and use\n– Compatible with Procreate on iPad\n– Great for fashion sketches, textile design, digital collages, and more\n– Bonus: 4 of the brushes come with additional inverted grain variations, allowing you to use them easily with both light and dark colors. (i.e: 13 main brushes + 4 brushes with inverted grains).",
  "fullDescription": "<p> Bring your fashion illustrations and digital artwork to life with this premium set of 13 Procreate fabric texture brushes! Designed to mimic the look and feel of real textiles, these brushes are perfect for fashion sketches, textile illustrations, digital collages, and surface pattern designs. They add realistic fabric effects with ease, including; Corduroy, Quilt, Lace, Twill/Denim, Heather, Leather, Felt….and more. </p>\n<p>Features:<br>\n– 13 High-quality Procreate brushes of seamless fabric textures.<br>\n– Easy to install and use<br>\n– Compatible with Procreate on iPad<br>\n– Great for fashion sketches, textile design, digital collages, and more<br>\n– Bonus: 4 of the brushes come with additional inverted grain variations, allowing you to use them easily with both light and dark colors. (i.e: 13 main brushes + 4 brushes with inverted grains).</p>",
